  "solution": "Let's apply each option into the given equation:\n\n71 * 56 * 14 * 15 * 5\n\nOption 1) +, ÷, =, ×\n\n71 + __56 ÷ 14__ = 15 × 5\n\n71 + 4 = __15 × 5__\n\n71 + 4 = 75\n\n75 = 75\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) ×, =, -, +\n\n__71 × 56__ = 14 - 15 + 5\n\n3976 = __14__ - 15 __+ 5__\n\n3976 = 19 - 15\n\n3976 ≠ 4 \n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3)+, -, =, ​×\n\n71 + 56 - 14 = __15 × 5__\n\n__71 +____ 56__ - 14 = 75 \n\n__127 - 14__ = 75\n\n113 ≠ 75\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) =, -, ÷, ​×\n\n71 = 56 - __14 ÷ 15__ ​× 5\n\n71 = 56 - __0.93 ​____× 5__\n\n71 = 56 - 4.6\n\n71 ≠ 51.4\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**+, ÷, =, ×\".**\n\n5d:Tad",
